Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:51.43,CN-Quote,,0,0,0,,“在你唾弃这些孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:56.00,CN-Quote,,0,0,0,,想要改变世界的努力时\N他们早已对你的意见免疫了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:02:00.24,CN-Quote,,0,0,0,,他们很清楚自己正在经历什么\N——大卫·鲍伊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.18,0:02:09.18,CN-Sign,,0,0,0,,（谢曼高中）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.67,0:02:14.30,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,1984 年 3 月 24 日 周六
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.67,0:02:14.30,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Brian: Saturday,\nMarch 24th, 1984.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:18.72,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,谢曼高中 伊利诺伊州谢曼市 邮编 60062
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:18.72,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Shermer High School,\nShermer, Illinois 60062.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.73,0:02:26.81,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,亲爱的弗农先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.73,0:02:26.81,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Dear Mr. Vernon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.30,0:02:27.00,CN-Sign,,0,0,0,,（学生商店）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:29.31,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们接受牺牲一整个周六
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:29.31,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,We accept the fact that we had\nto sacrifice a whole Saturday
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:29.57,CN-Sign,,0,0,0,,（我在吃我的头）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:33.24,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,为自己犯的错在学校留堂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:33.24,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,in detention for whatever\nit was we did wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:36.32,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们确实做错了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:36.32,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,What we did was wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:35.41,CN-Sign,,0,0,0,,（《谢曼高中斗牛犬报》）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.32,0:02:36.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们觉得荒唐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.32,0:02:36.96,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,but we think you're crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:37.14,CN-Sign,,0,0,0,,（我不喜欢周一）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:40.66,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你让我们写篇文章 说自己是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:40.66,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,to make us write an essay telling you\nwho we think we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.66,0:02:44.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你又不是真在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.66,0:02:44.29,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:46.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们在你心中早有既定形象
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:46.33,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,You see us\nas you want to see us
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.29,0:02:46.42,CN-Sign,,0,0,0,,（毕业生展翅高飞）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:47.94,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,简单说来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:47.94,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,in the simplest terms,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.49,0:02:47.19,CN-Sign,,0,0,0,,（救命 救命）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.94,0:02:50.84,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,也就是那些顺手拈来的定义
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.94,0:02:50.84,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,in the most convenient definitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.26,0:02:49.12,CN-Sign,,0,0,0,,（年度优等生）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:54.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你把我们分类为优等生 体育特长生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:54.88,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,You see us as a brain, an athlete,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:58.47,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,无可救药的怪胎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:58.47,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,a basket case,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:55.76,CN-Sign,,0,0,0,,（学生顾问 桥本博士）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:02:58.20,CN-Sign,,0,0,0,,（选举你的舞会皇后）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:03:00.60,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,公主
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:03:00.60,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:00.67,CN-Sign,,0,0,0,,（打开这个储物柜）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:02.52,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,或者罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:02.52,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,and a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:05.52,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:05.52,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:11.94,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们今天早上 7 点 也是这么看待彼此的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:11.94,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,That's the way\nwe saw each other at 7:00 this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:11.81,CN-Sign,,0,0,0,,（你就死定了基佬）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:13.44,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们被洗脑了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:13.44,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,We were brainwashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:27.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我简直不敢相信你不能让我免于留堂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:27.62,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- I can't believe\nyou can't get me out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.63,0:03:32.59,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我周六还要来这真是太荒谬了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.63,0:03:32.59,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,It's so absurd I have\nto be here on a Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:35.76,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我又不是智障
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:35.76,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,It's not like\nI'm a defective or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:37.05,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我会补偿你的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:37.05,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- I'll make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.05,0:03:40.93,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,宝贝 翘课去逛街不代表你智障
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.05,0:03:40.93,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Honey, ditching class\nto go shopping doesn't make you a defective.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:42.68,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,祝你一天愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:42.68,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:50.61,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这是我们第一次留堂 还是最后一次？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:50.61,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Is this the first time\nor the last time we do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.61,0:03:52.11,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.61,0:03:52.11,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:54.65,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,进去好好利用这段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:54.65,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Well, get in there and use\nthe time to your advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:56.11,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,妈 你知道我们留堂 不是用来学习的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:56.11,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Mom, we're not supposed\nto study.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:57.61,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们只能坐着 什么也不干
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:57.61,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,We just have to sit there\nand do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:04:00.45,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,反正你得找个方式学习 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:04:00.45,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Well, mister, you figure out\na way to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.74,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.74,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:04.78,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:04.78,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Well, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:12.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我以前也瞎搞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:12.96,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Hey, I screwed around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:16.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,男孩子都爱瞎闹 这没什么大不了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:16.38,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Guys screw around. There's nothing wrong with that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:18.47,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,只不过你被抓到了 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:18.47,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,except you got caught, sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:20.76,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我妈已经骂过我了 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:20.76,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, mom already reamed me,\nall right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:25.14,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你想错过比赛吗？ 你想丢掉奖学金吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:25.14,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- You want to miss a match? You want to blow your ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:28.60,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,没有学校会愿意给一个 目无纪律的人奖学金的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:28.60,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Now, no school is going\nto give a scholarship to a discipline case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.11,0:06:01.61,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,很好很好 都来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.11,0:06:01.61,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Well, well, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:04.74,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,恭喜你们 都准时到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:04.74,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,I want to congratulate you\nfor being on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:06.20,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,抱歉 老师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:06.20,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:07.53,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我觉得你肯定是搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:07.53,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,I think there's been a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:10.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我知道这是留堂的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:10.58,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,I know it's detention, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:14.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,但是我不觉得我应该来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:14.54,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think I belong in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:18.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,现在是 7 点过 6 分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:18.54,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- It is now 7:06.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:21.22,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你有 8 小时 54 分时间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:21.22,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,You have exactly\n8 hours and 54 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:23.72,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,可以用来考虑你为什么在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:23.72,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,to think about\nwhy you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:26.10,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,思索一下你自己的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:26.10,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Ponder the error of your ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.85,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你们不能说话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.85,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,And you may not talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:35.06,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,也不能从座位上离开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:35.06,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,You will not move\nfrom these seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.15,0:06:40.23,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,还有你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.15,0:06:40.23,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:41.86,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不能睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:41.86,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,will not sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:50.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,好了 同学们 我们今天要来点不一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:50.29,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,All right, people,\nwe're going to try something a little different today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:53.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们要写一篇论文
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:53.96,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,We are going to write an essay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:57.59,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不少于一千字
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:57.59,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,of no less than 1,000 words
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.59,0:07:01.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-向我描述 你认为你到底是谁 -这是考试吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.59,0:07:01.17,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,describing to me\nwho you think you are. - Is this a test?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:03.89,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我说了是论文
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:03.89,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- And when I say essay,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:05.55,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,那就是论文
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:05.55,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,I mean essay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:12.14,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我可没说把一个单词写一千遍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:12.14,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,I do not mean a single word\nrepeated 1,000 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:14.23,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,听清了吗 本德先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:14.23,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Is that clear, Mr. Bender?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:15.73,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,非常清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:15.73,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:18.73,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,很好 也许你会更了解自己一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:18.73,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Good, maybe you'll learn\na little something about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:24.82,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,也许你甚至会决定是否还会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:24.82,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll even decide whether\nor not you care to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:26.61,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我现在就能回答这个问题 老师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:26.61,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, you know, I can answer\nthat right now, sir, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.28,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,对我来说肯定是“不” 因为……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.28,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,that'd be no.\nNo for me because--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.16,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,坐下 强生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.16,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Sit down, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:31.87,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,谢谢 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:31.87,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.29,0:07:35.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我的办公室就在走廊对面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.29,0:07:35.62,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- My office\nis right across that hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:38.16,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,任何偷鸡摸狗的行为 都是被严令禁止的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:38.16,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Any monkey business\nis ill advised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:40.13,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,还有问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:40.13,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:44.59,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,有 我有一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:44.59,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, I got a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:47.68,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,巴里·马尼洛知道你翻了他的衣柜吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:47.68,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Does Barry Manilow know\nthat you raid his wardrobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:52.18,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我可以回答你这个问题 下个周六回答 本德先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:52.18,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,- Give you the answer\nto that question, Mr. Bender, next Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:54.60,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别去招惹公牛 年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:54.60,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with the bull,\nyoung man,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:56.06,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,小心被牛角顶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:56.06,EN-Main,,0,0,0,,you'll get the horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.11,0:08:01.61,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,那家伙就是个爱舔屁股的
